---
import Layout from '../layouts/Layout.astro';
import { site } from '../data/site';
// Plain-language notice describing what the site actually does. Owner review pending (see README).
---
<Layout title={`Privacy Notice | ${site.name}`} description={`How ${site.name} collects and uses the information you send through this website.`}>
  <section class="section wrap prose">
    <p class="eyebrow">Privacy notice</p>
    <h1>Your information, <em>plainly.</em></h1>
    <p class="mono updated">Last updated: October 15, 2026</p>

    <h2>What we collect</h2>
    <p>When you send a request through our forms, we receive what you type: your name, phone number, email address, what you’re interested in, the model and community you pick, and any notes.</p>
    <p>If you open "Tell us more" on a form, we also receive the optional details you choose to give: how you would like us to reach you, where you are in the process, your timeline, a budget range, and whether you tick the first-time buyer or VA / military boxes. We also record which form and which of our websites the request came from.</p>
    <p>We count page visits three ways. Our own traffic analytics uses no cookies and sets no identifiers on your device. It records which pages you viewed, how long you spent on each, the site you arrived from, and your browser and device type. It does not record your IP address: our server counts unique visitors using a scrambled value that changes every day, so no one can be tracked from one visit to the next, and we keep the region you visited from, not a precise location. If your browser sends a “Do Not Track” or “Global Privacy Control” signal, our analytics is switched off for that visit. Vercel Web Analytics does not use cookies and does not identify you personally. Google Analytics uses cookies to measure how visitors find and use the site (pages viewed, approximate location, device and how you arrived). We use it to improve the site and do not use it to run our own advertising. You can block it with your browser’s cookie settings or the <a href="https://tools.google.com/dlpage/gaoptout" rel="noopener" target="_blank">Google Analytics opt-out add-on<span class="sr-only"> (opens in a new tab)</span></a>.</p>

    <p>If you use the chat assistant on this site, we keep the messages you type and the assistant’s replies, and if you give your name, phone number or email there, we save them as a request just like a form. The assistant is an AI, not a person. Please don’t type Social Security, bank or card numbers into the chat. If you ask for a tour or call, we save the date and time you ask for. Our team reads chats to follow up with you.</p>

    <h2>Why we use it</h2>
    <p>Only to answer your request: to call or email you about homes, financing and tours you asked about, and to reply to texts you send us. We don’t sell your information.</p>

    <h2>Who handles it</h2>
    <ul>
      <li>The {site.name} team, who receive your request by email.</li>
      <li>Vercel, which hosts this website and keeps standard server logs that can include your IP address and browser type.</li>
      <li>Google, which provides Google Analytics and the Gmail inbox where our team reads form emails.</li>
      <li>BuildZoom, whose badge in our footer loads from their servers and counts how often it is shown.</li>
      <li>Resend, which delivers the form email to our team.</li>
      <li>Supabase, which stores a copy of your request in our private database so it isn’t lost if an email fails.</li>
      <li>Anthropic, whose AI model writes the chat assistant’s replies. The messages you type in the chat are sent to it for that purpose.</li>
    </ul>
    <p>If you ask about financing, we may pass your contact details to the lender you choose to work with, with your permission.</p>

    <h2>How long we keep it</h2>
    <p>We keep your request for at least one month after you send it, and longer while we are working with you or need it to answer your follow-up questions. You can ask us to delete it at any time (see Your choices below).</p>

    <h2>Texts</h2>
    <p>Giving us your phone number on a form lets us call you about your request. It does not sign you up for text messages. We text only people who text us first, and we do not send marketing or promotional texts. If you text our number, an automated assistant (an AI, not a person) replies, and we keep the conversation so our team can follow up. Message frequency varies, and message and data rates may apply. Reply STOP at any time and we will not text you again. Reply HELP for help. The full text-messaging terms are at <a href="/sms-terms/">/sms-terms/</a>. We do not share mobile information, including phone numbers and texting consent, with third parties for their marketing or promotional purposes.</p>

    <h2>Your choices</h2>
    <p>Some browsers send a "Do Not Track" or "Global Privacy Control" signal. Our own traffic analytics respects those signals and is switched off when it receives them. Google Analytics and the BuildZoom badge may still collect information about your visits across different websites over time, and you can turn Google Analytics off with the opt-out add-on above.</p>
    <p>To see, correct or delete what you’ve sent us, email <a href={`mailto:${site.email}`}>{site.email}</a> or call <a href={site.phoneHref}>{site.phone}</a>.</p>

    <h2>Children</h2>
    <p>This website is not meant for children under 16, and we do not knowingly collect their information.</p>

    <h2>Contact</h2>
    <p>{site.currentEntity} (doing business as {site.name}, {site.license}), {site.address}. Phone <a href={site.phoneHref}>{site.phone}</a>. Email <a href={`mailto:${site.email}`}>{site.email}</a>.</p>
  </section>
</Layout>

<style>
  .prose { max-width: 760px; }
  .updated { font-size: .75rem; color: var(--muted); margin: 0 0 1.5rem; }
  .prose h2 { font-size: 1.6rem; margin-top: 2.2rem; }
  .prose ul { padding-left: 1.2rem; }
</style>
